1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,950
…Mr. Cole?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,950
Abby. I can— let me explain—

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,172
Is my name on this?

4
00:00:08,222 --> 00:00:09,950
I didn't sign it.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,950
That's not what I asked.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,950
You want me to hate him? I can hate
him.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,950
I'm really good at it.

8
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,950
I don't know what I want.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,950
She hasn't been in since Tuesday.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,950
Grant wants to know why it's not
signed. Also?

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,950
I'm done lying for you.

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,950
…Good. Tell him it's not signed.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,236
Waiting on someone?

14
00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:49,950
No. I mean— no.

15
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,950
I'm gonna… go get more clay.

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,575
My name's Hunter Cole. I started Lumen
at nineteen. Ten years later, I

17
00:01:03,625 --> 00:01:06,950
didn't know one person in my own
building.

18
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,170
So I took a desk on four, where nobody
knew me. Then you rolled your chair

19
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:14,950
into it.

20
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:22,475
I've had all this money for ten years
and never did one thing with it. Until

21
00:01:22,525 --> 00:01:24,950
you made me throw an axe.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,950
You lied to me. For weeks. You know
who else did that?

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,283
…Your dad.

24
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:31,950
Yeah.

25
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,950
And my whole team—

26
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,950
I'm not signing it.

27
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,950
Because of me?

28
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,950
Because you were right. Everybody eats
at their desk.

29
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,950
That's so annoying.

30
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:46,750
It's hideous.

31
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:47,950
It's so hideous.

32
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:51,950
I don't know if I can trust you yet.

33
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,950
Okay. What would it take?

34
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,950
Monday. All-hands. Camera on.
